                                "sense_id": "4aba5d3f-b2fb-33b2-80cf-28d1b8987313",
                                "text": "Because it wasn’t quite clear what the parameters of the list were — Hotness? Naughtiness? Sexuality? Purity? — everyone was left to ponder, in their own way, how to get more popular, by balancing the various strands of admiration, fascination, respect, and despicability that comprise modern celebrity."
